IF @mode != "explain"
    RETURN "PR explanation was not selected."

USE ../../references/be-human.md AS writing_guidance
USE ../../references/technical-summary.md#summary-content AS summary_rules

DO Read @ticket_path and @pr_path together. Return an object with saved_pr and
    the exact unrequested sections that must be preserved. AS documents

DO Check branch and HEAD before reusing implementation evidence. Inspect
    committed changes only for material gaps and reuse other verified evidence.
    Do not fetch, choose a target, or run a readiness pass. Return the verified
    evidence and observed checks. AS evidence

DO Explain @documents.saved_pr using @evidence, @writing_guidance, and
    @summary_rules without writing files. Distinguish prior readiness from
    current state. Return a concise report with the changed path or observed
    checks, verified PR URL or state when available, requested explanation,
    blockers, gaps, and partial success. AS explanation

PRINT @explanation
